{#
  Activity table, shown under the Proposed BEPs table. The Extension
  column and PR number come from data/beps/beps.yml at build time; the other
  cells are placeholders that docs/javascripts/bep_dashboard.js fills in the
  browser from the bids-schema BEPs/dashboard.json feed, so they stay current
  without redeploying the website.
#}
<p class="bep-dashboard-status" data-src="{{ dashboard_url }}">Activity data is loaded from <a href="https://github.com/bids-standard/bids-schema/tree/main/BEPs">bids-schema</a> and needs JavaScript.</p>

| Extension | Days since last activity | PR / #&nbsp;Authors / #&nbsp;Commenters / Build | Reviews | Days since last PR comment / #&nbsp;Comments / #&nbsp;Unresolved |
| :-------: | :----------------------- | :------------------------------------ | :------ | :----------------------------------------------------- |
{% for bep in include %}
{% set num = bep.number | int %}
| [BEP {{ bep.number }}]({% if bep.link %}{{ bep.link }}{% else %}./beps/bep_{{ bep.number }}.md{% endif %}) | <span data-bep="{{ num }}" data-field="activity">…</span> | {% if bep.pull_request %}[{{ bep.pull_request.rstrip("/").split("/")[-1] }}]({{ bep.pull_request }})<span data-bep="{{ num }}" data-field="pr_rest">/…</span>{% else %}—{% endif %} | <span data-bep="{{ num }}" data-field="reviews">…</span> | <span data-bep="{{ num }}" data-field="comments">…</span> |
{% endfor %}

**Days since last activity**: the most recent of a Google Doc edit, PR commit, or PR comment, with the source named
(hover for all three dates) · 🟢 within the last {{ fresh_days }} days · 🟡 within the last 6 months · 🔴 longer ago.
**Reviews**: approved ✅ / changes requested ❌ / commented 💬.
**#&nbsp;Unresolved**: open inline review threads on the PR.

Look [here](https://github.com/bids-standard/bids-schema/tree/main/BEPs)
for the BEP `schema_pp.json` files and this table's source data.

{# Hidden until bep_dashboard.js finds a PR to mark; md_in_html renders the admonition inside. #}
<div id="bep-not-schema-ready" class="bep-dashboard-note" hidden markdown>

!!! note

    PRs marked with \* currently have no schema build in
    [bids-schema](https://github.com/bids-standard/bids-schema/tree/main/BEPs).
    This can be because the PR doesn't change the BIDS schema,
    can't currently be merged into the specification (e.g., it has merge conflicts),
    has been closed or merged,
    or was opened too recently to have been processed yet.
    Their activity isn't tracked, so their status is uncertain.

</div>
